---
import StudioLayout from '../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro';
---
<StudioLayout title="Chemistry - Class 11 with Harshith" chapterChip="Class 11 · Chemistry">
  <section class="screen active">
    <div class="hero">
      <h1><span class="accent">Chem</span>istry</h1>
      <p>Class 11 chemistry, chapter by chapter - interactive lessons for the smartboard, built to explore live in class.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <a class="tile" href="/chemistry/classification-of-elements" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;">
        <div class="tile-num">01</div>
        <div class="tile-icon ic-build">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M3 15h18M9 3v18M15 3v18"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Classification of <span class="accent">Elements</span></h3>
        <p>How the periodic table was built, and how effective nuclear charge and shielding shape atomic & ionic size.</p>
        <span class="tile-go">2 topics - Open ›</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</StudioLayout>
